{"requirements":[{"id":"R1","requirement":"Provide a repaired, runnable reservation utility that accepts a nonempty request ID and positive integer quantity.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The installed executable uses Python 3, validates argument count, request ID, and quantity, and a positive request succeeds while zero is rejected.","evidence_ids":["cmd-c98ca050979a4204","cmd-144775174ffe47e8","cmd-bd0b1c20de894fbd"]},{"id":"R2","requirement":"Decrement stock exactly once for a successful request and replay the earlier result when its request ID is repeated, while preserving existing reservations.","status":"satisfied","summary":"A new request reduced stock from 5 to 3, repetition caused no further decrement, and two simultaneous clients using the same ID produced one reservation and one decrement. The pre-existing reservation remained unchanged and replayed its stored quantity even when invoked with a different quantity.","evidence_ids":["cmd-bd0b1c20de894fbd","cmd-34de691f1c5d4392","cmd-2d3a6394e3f442e7","cmd-c7d5f79a899f40ce"]},{"id":"R3","requirement":"Reject reservations when stock is insufficient without changing stock or recording the request.","status":"satisfied","summary":"An oversized request returned INSUFFICIENT_STOCK; final stock and reservations showed that only the prior successful request affected the database.","evidence_ids":["cmd-bd0b1c20de894fbd"]},{"id":"R4","requirement":"Handle competing reservations without lost updates or negative remaining stock.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Two concurrent four-unit requests against five units produced one success and one rejection, leaving one unit, a single reservation, and an intact database.","evidence_ids":["cmd-55afbce919b847fd"]},{"id":"R5","requirement":"Use bounded database-lock waits rather than hanging indefinitely.","status":"satisfied","summary":"While another process held a write lock for eight seconds, the utility returned DATABASE_BUSY after five seconds with exit 75 and made no re